name vis-anon-hostile-1
timeout 200

# THE ANONYMITY OF A VISUAL CONTACT, HALF TWO OF TWO. The pair is:
#
#   vis-anon-friend.fbm    the MiG-29 ahead is `team friendly`
#   vis-anon-hostile.fbm   the SAME MiG-29 is `team hostile`
#
# and the two files differ in exactly that one token. doc/sensors.md §9.7 makes the claim; this pair is
# what makes it checkable instead of asserted:
#
#   * the visual channel names a TYPE and never a side. What appears at 4x the detection threshold is
#     `mig29` -- the target module's own FBModuleRegistry key, the same string the mission file already
#     spells out in its `module` line. It says WHAT. It never says WHO and never says WHOSE.
#   * so the `vis` lines of events.log and the nine vis_* telemetry columns must be IDENTICAL between the
#     two runs, tick for tick and value for value. A single differing character in that channel would be
#     a leak of the registry's team through a sensor, which is the one thing the whole perception
#     boundary exists to prevent (CLAUDE.md "Kein Cheaten").
#   * and the FLIGHT must be identical too: every emitter is switched off in both files, so no other
#     channel can react to the faction either.
#
# The visual system is not even GIVEN a team: FBVisualSystem::SetIdentity takes a unit id and nothing
# else, so there is no member for a faction to be read out of. The mission pair measures what the type
# system already forbids -- both, because the type system can be changed and this measurement notices.
#
# WHAT TO READ: diff the two output directories. `events.log` differs only in the run's own wall-clock
# fields; `telemetry.csv` must be byte-identical.
#
# READING RULE: exit 3 = TIMEOUT is the verdict AND the pass. A measurement rig, not a task.

time 2026-06-21T11:00:00Z

unit viper
  module f16
  team friendly
  spawn 46.60000 6.90000 3000 0.0 300
  set gear up
  set fuel_pct 60
  set fcr_mode off                             # radar silent: nothing but the eyes may find anything
  set rwr off
  set datalink off                             # ...and no cooperative net, which WOULD know the faction
  wp 46.95932 6.90000 3000 300

unit bandit
  module mig29
  team hostile
  spawn 46.62695 6.89673 3000 0.0 200          # 3 km ahead, same heading, 100 kt slower
  set gear up
  set fuel_pct 60
  set n019_emission off
  set rwr off
  set task route
  wp 46.95932 6.89673 3000 200
